*2–6 December 2024 – Parliament held its second scrutiny week.<ref name="Scrutiny weeks" />
*22 May 2025 – [[2025 New Zealand budget|Budget 2025]] is delivered to Parliament.<ref>{{cite news |title=Budget 2025 at a glance: The big changes, winners and losers |url=https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/political/561810/budget-2025-at-a-glance-the-big-changes-winners-and-losers |access-date=23 May 2025 |work=[[Radio New Zealand]] |date=22 May 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250523104001/https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/political/561810/budget-2025-at-a-glance-the-big-changes-winners-and-losers |archive-date=23 May 2025|url-status=live}}</ref>
*16–20 June 2025 – Scrutiny week.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Waiwiri-Smirh |first1=Lyric |title=Swears, spending and 'making shit up': Inside scrutiny week, part one|url=https://thespinoff.co.nz/politics/18-06-2025/swears-spending-and-making-shit-up-inside-scrutiny-week-part-one |access-date=14 December 2025 |date=18 June 2025|website=[[The Spinoff]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260609093232/https://thespinoff.co.nz/politics/18-06-2025/swears-spending-and-making-shit-up-inside-scrutiny-week-part-one|archive-date=9 June 2026|url-status=live}}</ref>
